    "title": "New Pendragon Theatre near completion - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Teah Dowling ,\n14 hours ago The audience seating of the new Pendragon Theatre on Woodruff Street — SARANAC LAKE | The new Pendragon Theatre on Woodruff Street is about a month away from completion. “The initial conception came up about 10 years ago because our old facility was in disrepair. It would have cost us so much money just to keep it afloat,” shared Michael Aguirre, managing director of Pendragon Theatre. “So, the idea was to invest in something new and make a move downtown to the village.” Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
